import ../../../ui/source_workspace.dl
import ../../../ui/document_declarations.dl

document example:
    editor "Studio" containing "print line 7" using no UI appearance
    editor "Challenge" containing "move right" using no UI appearance

to [prepare a token in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [on line] {integer:row}:
    set source to editor's document
    free source's token types
    set source's token types to a JSON array containing [a new JSON-RPC text for "keyword"]
    free source's tokens
    set source's tokens to a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a JSON array containing [
        a new JSON-RPC integer for row, a new JSON-RPC integer for 0,
        a new JSON-RPC integer for 4, a new JSON-RPC integer for 0, a new JSON-RPC integer for 0
    ])]
    set source's token revision to source's revision

set instance to an instance of example
set window to the address of instance
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
set plain to the UI source editor labeled "Studio" in workspace
set challenge to the UI source editor labeled "Challenge" in workspace
set files to a new JSON-RPC object
configure UI source document (challenge's document) named "game.dl" at "file:///workspace/game.dl" prefixed by "import game.dl\n" using UI CPU analysis with files files
free files
prepare a token in plain on line 0
prepare a token in challenge on line 1
set theme to [@intrinsic("construct", UI source token style, "keyword", UI ink 10 20 30)]
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
set {plain value} to the UI value for (plain's node) in window
set {challenge value} to the UI value for (challenge's node) in window
require condition ((plain value's colors' ink's red = 10) and (challenge value's colors' ink's red = 10)) reporting "The initial token theme was not shared by ordinary and wrapped sources."
set revision to instance's revision
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
require condition (instance's revision = revision) reporting "An unchanged token theme repainted unchanged analysis."
set theme to [@intrinsic("construct", UI source token style, "keyword", UI ink 40 50 60)]
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
require condition ((plain value's colors' ink's red = 40) and (challenge value's colors' ink's blue = 60)) reporting "Changing a theme left cached syntax colors in either editor."
require condition ((plain's document's revision = 1) and (challenge's document's revision = 2)) reporting "Changing syntax colors modified a source document."
set revision to instance's revision
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
require condition (instance's revision = revision) reporting "The replacement token theme was not cached."
set theme to [@intrinsic("construct", UI source token style, "comment", UI ink 40 50 60)]
present UI source workspace workspace using theme
require condition ((plain value's colors' ink's red = 245) and (challenge value's colors' ink's red = 245)) reporting "Changing only a token class did not invalidate the palette."
free UI source workspace workspace
close window
print line "Source themes refresh ordinary and wrapped editors without reanalysis or unchanged redraws."
